{"id": "seed-num-02", "category": "numeric", "prompt_version": 2, "requested_model": "opus", "cli_version": "2.1.302 (Claude Code)", "a": 9.0, "b": 10.0, "diff": -1.0, "outcome": "loss", "identical": false, "a_criteria": {"correctness": 4.0, "completeness": 2.0, "groundedness": 2.0, "usefulness": 1.0}, "b_criteria": {"correctness": 4.0, "completeness": 3.0, "groundedness": 2.0, "usefulness": 1.0}, "orders": [{"a_pos": "A", "a": {"correctness": 4, "completeness": 2, "groundedness": 2, "usefulness": 1}, "b": {"correctness": 4, "completeness": 3, "groundedness": 2, "usefulness": 1}, "preferred": "b", "rationale": "Both are correct: 480.04 vs 233.72 per km², a gap of 246.32 (arithmetic checked). B also gives the ratio (2.05 times as dense), answering 'by how much' more fully. A just repeats the difference. Both share the same area figure for the Netherlands. B's '(2024)' label for Germany is a minor unverified addition.", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "models_used": ["claude-opus-5-5"], "cost_usd": 0.042524, "duration_ms": 13054, "num_turns": 2, "web_search_requests": 0}, {"a_pos": "B", "a": {"correctness": 4, "completeness": 2, "groundedness": 2, "usefulness": 1}, "b": {"correctness": 4, "completeness": 3, "groundedness": 2, "usefulness": 1}, "preferred": "b", "rationale": "Both answers have correct arithmetic (480.04 vs 233.72, difference 246.32) and cite the same sources. A also gives the ratio (2.05×), which answers \"by how much\" more fully. B repeats the difference without adding anything. A is slightly more complete and useful.", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "models_used": ["claude-opus-5-5"], "cost_usd": 0.0459124, "duration_ms": 17409, "num_turns": 2, "web_search_requests": 0}]}
